<title>USA: SJNB Financial to repurchase stock.</title>
<headline>SJNB Financial to repurchase stock.</headline>
<dateline>SAN JOSE, Calif. 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>SJNB Financial Corp said it will repurchase up to $2.5 million of its common stock, representing about five percent of its shares outstanding based on January 19 prices.</p>
<p>Under the program, the company said it will repurchase shares from time to time through open market and privately negotiated transactions &quot;at prices deemed appropriate by management.&quot;</p>
<p>It said the repurchase program would help it fund future employee stock option programs.</p>
